# Tor SOCKS5 for SearXNG engine egress (see docker-compose.yml service `tor`).
# Only engines wired via settings.yml outgoing.networks.tor route through here;
# everything else (incl. google) keeps the direct network path.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
# Rotate general-purpose circuits every 2 min so pre-flagged exits are
# left quickly (DDG 403 / Brave 429 are exit-IP-bound; verified 2026-09-12
# that exit quality is the deciding factor).
MaxCircuitDirtiness 120

# Only the compose bridge networks may use this proxy.
SocksPolicy accept 127.0.0.1
SocksPolicy accept 172.16.0.0/12
SocksPolicy accept 192.168.0.0/16
SocksPolicy reject *

Log notice stdout